  "details": "I am on an IPhone 13, using IOS 17.0.0\n\nThe current build of VRchat installed is 333. \n\nI am testing on lower end hardware, and simply, nothing can properly load. I tested using both a frequently visited world I go to (Just B Club 3), and another world for testing (1’s Optimized Box). \n\nFor Just B Club 3, I could not even load into the world without immediately crashing upon the load finishing. For 1’s Optimized Box, I could load into the world fine, and my frame rate was stable and seemed to be at least around 30, but upon my avatar loading, I was also immediately crashed",
